        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "We are hiring for a Senior Node.js Backend Developer with 5–8 years of experience to join our team in Karachi on-site.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n- Design and develop scalable backend services using Node.js\n- Build secure RESTful APIs and microservices\n- Optimize performance, reliability, and system architecture\n- Collaborate with product, frontend, and DevOps teams\n- Ensure code quality, security, and best development practices\n\nRequirements:\n- 5–8 years of backend development experience\n- Strong expertise in Node.js and JavaScript/TypeScript\n- Experience with databases (MongoDB/MySQL/PostgreSQL)\n- Solid understanding of system design, APIs, and security standards\n- Experience in fintech/payments is a strong plus\n\nInterested candidates can apply by sending their resumes to aqsa.javed@kamelpay.com.",
