      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/asimahmood_nextjs-frontend-developer-location-karachi-activity-7450882245944385536-B1LW": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-10-29T10:07:29.770673+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Next.js Frontend Developer\nLocation: Karachi\n\nWe are looking for a skilled Next.js Frontend Developer to join our growing team. If you’re passionate about building fast, scalable, and user-friendly web applications, we’d love to hear from you!\n\nKey Responsibilities:\nDevelop and maintain web applications using Next.js and React.js\nBuild reusable, efficient, and scalable frontend components\nOptimize applications for maximum speed and performance\nCollaborate with backend developers and designers\nEnsure responsiveness across devices and browsers\n\nRequirements:\nProven experience with Next.js and React.js\nStrong grip on JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5, CSS3\nExperience with API integration (REST/GraphQL)\nFamiliarity with version control (Git)\nUnderstanding of SEO and web performance optimization\nGood problem-solving and communication skills\nExposure to POS or eCommerce solutions\n\nApply Now: Share your profile at jobs@imtiaz.com.pk, mentioning “Next.js Developer” in the subject line",
          "posted_at": "2026-04-17T12:25:58.105Z"
        }
      },
